From: Anass EREKYSY <ereanass@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 20:04:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Projects: live links on every card, KickBack rename, updated
 stacks

- New liveUrl on projects, shown as "Live demo" on featured cards and tiles,
  and as "Live site" in the detail panel (EN/FR)
- Buy & Bye renamed KickBack, with its live site and both repositories
- Live links for Plumb, Cockpit, KickBack, MarketPulse, Melodify, RaiseUp,
  ShowTracker and Skinet
- Stacks updated to the 2026 redesigns
- GitHub link labels translated

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011jqZBQP9sTRwuZfiWtPZTU
